  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen avser en bist&#xE5;ndskredit, via AB SEK som agent, p&#xE5; 18 310 000 SEK till The republic of Philippines via Finansdepartementet ifr&#xE5;n The Government of Sweden represented by Sida. F&#xF6;rsta utbetalningen gjordes i noveber 1998 och den sista i februari 2002. I december 2008 slutbetaldes l&#xE5;net i dess helhet till AB SEK.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contribution is a Development loan, by AB SEK as agent, of 18 310 SEK to the republic of Philippines represented by the department of Finance and The Government of Sweden represented by Sida. The first disbursement was made in november 1998 and the last disbursement in february 2002. In december 2008 was the final repayment recieved and the loan was totally repaid.</narrative>
  </description>
